// Library build only — no tests.
//
// The default tsconfig.json deliberately includes src/__tests__ so that
// `npm run test:core` can compile and run them. The enclave image must NOT
// use it, for two reasons:
//
//   1. Several tests import @mikeargento/bitgraph-audit, which the enclave
//      build context does not copy (the enclave has no use for the audit
//      package). tsc then exits 2 and the EIF build fails. This silently
//      broke the reproducible build from 2026-07-10, when the audit tests
//      landed, until 2026-07-29.
//   2. Dockerfile.enclave copies /build/dist/ into the production image, so
//      compiling tests put dist/__tests__/*.js inside the measured boundary.
//      Test code has no business being measured into PCR0.
//
// Keep this file in sync with tsconfig.json for everything except `include`.
{
  "extends": "./tsconfig.json",
  "include": ["src/**/*.ts"],
  "exclude": ["node_modules", "dist", "src/__tests__"]
}
